<v Bender>[重叠的声音]

00:42:59.410 --> 00:43:09.430
<v Molly Ringwald>So then I'm thinking, she's going to ask me, what are they talking about? But then she just didn't ask. She was not-- all of that stuff she just didn't want to know.
<v Molly Ringwald>所以我当时想，她会问我，他们在说什么？但她就是没问。她不是——所有那些事她就是不想知道。

